ion**, set the **Columns** (2 in the image)\n5. Under **Frames**, click the **Add element** button (3 in the image)\n\nNothing happens.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[tilemap_layer_test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22115712/tilemap_layer_test.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110221/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110221/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}